  "definition_ja": "平面上で、1 つの点（中心）から等しい距離にある点の集まり。その距離を半径という。",
  "definition_en": "The set of all points in a plane that are the same distance from a fixed point, called the center. That distance is the radius.",
  "latex": null,
  "spoken_en": null,
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "Every point on the circle is 5 units from the center.",
      "ja": "円の上のどの点も、中心からの距離は 5 だ。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Find the area of a circle with a radius of 3 cm.",
      "ja": "半径 3 cm の円の面積を求めよ。",
